From 2bcd676817c3c7428570e6f84afd2ab87df11a80 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MiaAI-Lab <MiaAI-Lab@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 02:10:48 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] glm: DSpark drafter (RedHatAI/GLM-5.3-speculator.dspark) on
 glm_moe_dsa

--drafter <folder> with speculators_model_type "dspark" loads DSpark instead of DFlash2. The engine side is
DFlash2's Drafter (slots, rings, taps, requests, lanes, followers) with `spark` set; its ingest, block pass and
selection dispatch to dspark.zig:
- context rows: fc (bf16) over the 5 taps, hidden_norm, per layer [k | v] (4 bits), k_norm + neox RoPE (theta 8e6)
  into the stream's ring (ds_ctx_kv; 3 layers x K, V x 2048 x 4096 bf16, 101 MB);
- block [anchor, mask x 7] at p..p+7: 3 Qwen3 layers (q_norm / k_norm, neox RoPE; ds_block_qkv), multi-head
  attention over the window [p - 2048, p) and the block causally (ds_attn_part / ds_attn_merge, 64 heads of 64),
  o, SwiGLU MLP (4-bit gate|up, bf16 down), final norm, the verifier's 4-bit draft head, each rank's 16 best a
  slot (DFlash2's top16 kernels), gathered;
- rank 0: candidates merged (value desc, id asc), Markov score base + W2[c] . W1[prev] (prev_0 = anchor) in f64,
  confidence sigmoid(w_h . h + w_m . W1[prev] + b); slots 0..6 are the 7 drafts and their chances.
DFlash2's TAP_ROW / ring_bytes become the Drafter's tap_row / ring_size (max_ring_bytes for sizes taken before a
drafter is read); the engine taps and ingests prompt chunks on glm_moe_dsa when the drafter is DSpark.

Ported from the owner's 3x recipe patches 0114 / 0125 (dspark.py; MiaAI-Lab/GLM-5.3-EXL3-3x-DGX-Sparks-TensorFold),
which adapted the model definition from vllm-project/speculators @ 36a19ca and the sequential top-k Markov sampling
from vLLM @ 5f30fc7 (Apache-2.0); kernel check night/bin/dscheck (ctx_kv, block_qkv, attention vs a CPU reference).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
